WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.140
Use the top menu to move around Homecare.

00:00:03.644 --> 00:00:06.707
Open Products, then Browse competitors.

00:00:06.657 --> 00:00:11.542
Choose a retailer, type a product name, and use Category to narrow the
results.

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:14.424
Click Details on a product to see more.

00:00:14.988 --> 00:00:17.623
Click Select on the products you want.

00:00:17.573 --> 00:00:20.490
Open Products, then Compare selected.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:24.263
Click Export selected CSV to download your selection.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.555
Click News and updates in the top menu to open the news page.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:33.350
Open Insights, then Target inspiration to browse recommendations.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.668
Use the search box and filters to narrow them down.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.767
Click Home to return to the start.

00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:42.252
Help and guide opens this video.
